      "providerKind": "codex-cli",
      "model": "default",
      "prompt": "请填写本次改动目标、验收标准、允许修改范围和评审重点。",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 120,
      "status": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_commitstatus",
      "blockId": 3,
      "kind": "command",
      "title": "读取 Git 状态",
      "providerKind": "codex-cli",
      "model": "default",
      "prompt": "git status --short",
      "x": 590,
      "y": 120,
      "status": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_commitreview",
      "blockId": 4,
      "kind": "agent",
      "title": "Claude 提交前审查",
      "providerKind": "claude-cli",
      "model": "default",
      "prompt": "只审查，不修改文件。检查当前工作区的实际 diff，并对照变更目标判断是否完整、正确且保持兼容。重点检查逻辑错误、边界条件、安全性、错误处理、接口契约、测试缺口和无关改动。只输出有证据、值得在提交前处理的问题，按严重度列出文件/位置、影响和最小修复建议；最后列出已验证通过项。\n\n变更目标：\n{{blocks[2].text}}\n\nGit 状态：\n{{blocks[3].stdout}}",
      "x": 880,
      "y": 120,
      "status": "idle",
      "config": {
        "effort": "high",
        "mode": "plan",
        "retries": 0,
        "retryForever": false,
        "alwaysEnter": false,
        "autoSuccess": true,
        "claudePermissionMode": "acceptEdits",
        "claudeMode": "plan"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_commitfix",
      "blockId": 5,
      "kind": "agent",
      "title": "Codex 修正并测试",
      "providerKind": "codex-cli",
      "model": "default",
      "prompt": "处理提交前审查结果。逐条验证问题，只修复真实、相关且高价值的问题；保持 diff 小而聚焦，不做无关重构。按项目现有命令运行最小充分的测试、类型检查或构建。若某条建议不成立或不应修改，保留现状并说明理由。输出修复项、未采纳项、验证结果和剩余风险。\n\n变更目标：\n{{blocks[2].text}}\n\nClaude 审查：\n{{blocks[4].text}}",
      "x": 1170,
      "y": 120,
      "status": "idle",
      "config": {
        "effort": "medium",
        "retries": 0,
        "retryForever": false,
        "alwaysEnter": false,
        "autoSuccess": true,
        "codexApproval": "on-request",
        "codexSandbox": "workspace-write"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_commitcheck",
      "blockId": 6,
      "kind": "command",
      "title": "最终 Diff 检查",
      "providerKind": "codex-cli",
      "model": "default",
      "prompt": "git diff --check",
      "x": 1460,
      "y": 120,
      "status": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_commitmarkdown",
